+## Fetch artifacts
+
+When `download_attachments=true`, the browser workflow should capture assistant attachment/download buttons in the rendered ChatGPT page, suppress individual downloads, and return one `attachments_zip` metadata object for the in-page zip. `attachments_scroll=true` should force a top-to-bottom sweep first so virtualized attachment buttons are rendered before capture.
